WEBVTT

00:04.660 --> 00:06.540
This is the view by month,

00:07.240 --> 00:09.760
but you can also see the view by week.

00:10.480 --> 00:12.600
Here, you can select the week,

00:13.400 --> 00:17.120
for example, week 45. Today is Friday 6 November.

00:17.440 --> 00:21.360
I can see which people are working today.

00:22.260 --> 00:24.780
And thanks to this horizontal bar,

00:24.980 --> 00:30.200
I can see exactly what time and day it is.

00:30.200 --> 00:33.940
And I can see that Tomasz is working at the reception right now.

00:34.500 --> 00:37.420
Another example: the restaurant and bar.

00:37.920 --> 00:42.000
Three people are working there right now.

00:42.320 --> 00:46.800
Another important feature of ShiftSmith is the hour bank.

00:47.050 --> 00:50.830
For example, for November 2026,

00:51.010 --> 00:56.870
ShiftSmith keeps track of all the working hours of each employee:

00:57.230 --> 01:00.630
hours owed, hours worked, and the balance for each person.

01:01.310 --> 01:03.610
No more calculations at the end of the month.

01:03.790 --> 01:06.950
Here, I can also select the language,

01:07.700 --> 01:11.510
which translates the whole application.

01:11.910 --> 01:15.400
And I can also export the schedule

01:15.500 --> 01:18.000
in the selected language.

01:18.200 --> 01:20.600
So, this is the PDF:

01:21.900 --> 01:26.860
the export of the monthly schedule, November 2026.

01:27.160 --> 01:29.440
But here is the most important thing.

01:30.080 --> 01:33.440
ShiftSmith is not a product I sell as it is.

01:33.440 --> 01:35.020
It's just an example.

01:35.680 --> 01:37.980
Your hotel has its own rules,

01:38.620 --> 01:41.660
its own sections, its own way of working.

01:42.380 --> 01:46.020
I build a tool around your team, not the other way around.

01:46.640 --> 01:48.600
Try the demo, and let's talk.

01:49.300 --> 01:51.020
You can book a call just below.

01:51.800 --> 01:53.660
Thank you for your time, and see you soon.
